 * Vite client types: `import.meta.env` and the `*.css` side-effect imports.
 *
 * `vite` is aliased to `@voidzero-dev/vite-plus-core`, whose package root ships
 * no `client.d.ts` — but the `vite/client` type entry does resolve through its
